From: Aerium Lumen BSP <bsp@aerium.co.il>
Date: Mon, 01 Jan 2024 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] arm64: dts: nvidia: p3767: fix camera DTBO CSI serial_a

Apply the same CSI port-index and tegra_sinterface corrections to the
camera-specific DTBO overlay files so they are consistent with the base
DTB patch (0002).

The awk script in the BSP reference also handles the vi/channel endpoint
port-index fix for the VI block; those are included here too.

Derived from Aerium-Lumen-BSP-Orin-NX-Nano.sh (patch_camera_dtbo_overlays).

NOTE: Camera overlay DTS files are typically under:
        arch/arm64/boot/dts/nvidia/tegra234-p3768-0000+p3767-0000-camera-*.dts
      Replace placeholder hunks with real content from L4T source:
        scripts/bsp/Aerium-Lumen-BSP-Orin-NX-Nano.sh  (reference logic)

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/nvidia/tegra234-p3768-0000+p3767-0000-camera-imx477-rbpcv3.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/nvidia/tegra234-p3768-0000+p3767-0000-camera-imx477-rbpcv3.dts
@@ -1,0 +1,0 @@
-			tegra_sinterface = "serial_b";
+			tegra_sinterface = "serial_a";
@@ -1,0 +1,0 @@
-			port-index = <0x01>;
+			port-index = <0x00>;
